ons/thumb/4/49/Star_empty.svg/40px-Star_empty.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"108\" data-file-height=\"110\" /></span></span></span><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Allmusic&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Allmusic-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:middle\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/New_Record_Mirror\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"New Record Mirror\">New Record Mirror</a></i></td><td style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:middle\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\" title=\"4/5 stars\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"4/5 stars\"><img alt=\"Star\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/20px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/40px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"108\" data-file-height=\"110\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Star\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/20px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/40px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"108\" data-file-height=\"110\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Star\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/20px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/40px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"108\" data-file-height=\"110\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Star\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/20px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/40px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"108\" data-file-height=\"110\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/Star_empty.svg/20px-Star_empty.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/Star_empty.svg/40px-Star_empty.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"108\" data-file-height=\"110\" /></span></span></span><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-NewRecordMirror&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-NewRecordMirror-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Jimmy Watson of <i><a href=\"/wiki/New_Record_Mirror\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"New Record Mirror\">New Record Mirror</a></i> in a 4/5 star review exclaimed, \"A NEW and most exciting set from my all-time buddy Mr. 'B', Billy Eckstine. He is strongly supported by Quincy Jones and his big swinging band. As always the choice of material is excellent.\"<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-NewRecordMirror&#95;2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-NewRecordMirror-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Ron Wynn of <a href=\"/wiki/AllMusic\" title=\"AllMusic\">AllMusic</a> in a 3.5/5 star review called the album \"a fine live date with Quincy Jones leading the orchestra and writing the tracks.\"<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Allmusic&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Allmusic-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Track_listing\">Track listing</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=At_Basin_Street_East_(Billy_Eckstine_and_Quincy_Jones_album)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Track listing\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ol><li>\"<a href=\"/wiki/Alright,_Okay,_You_Win\" title=\"Alright, Okay, You Win\">Alright, Okay, You Win</a>\" (<a href=\"/wiki/Sid_Wyche\" title=\"Sid Wyche\">Sidney Wyche</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mayme_Watts\" title=\"Mayme Watts\">Mayme Watts</a>)</li>\n<li>Medley: \"I'm Falling for You\"/\"Fool That I Am\"/\"<a href=\"/wiki/Everything_I_Have_Is_Yours_(song)\" title=\"Everything I Have Is Yours (song)\">Everything I Have Is Yours</a>\" (<a href=\"/wiki/Burton_Lane\" title=\"Burton Lane\">Burton Lane</a>, George Sanders, Jr., <a href=\"/wiki/Clarence_Williams_(musician)\" title=\"Clarence Williams (musician)\">Clarence Williams</a>, Floyd Hunt, <a href=\"/wiki/Harold_Adamson\" title=\"Harold Adamson\">Harold Adamson</a>)</li>\n<li>\"<a href=\"/wiki/In_the_Still_of_the_Night_(1937_song)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"In the Still of the Night (1937 song)\">In the Still of the Night</a>\" (<a href=\"/wiki/Cole_Porter\" title=\"Cole Porter\">Cole Porter</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Duke_Ellington\" title=\"Duke Ellington\">Duke Ellington</a> medley: \"<a href=\"/wiki/Don%27t_Get_Around_Much_Anymore\" title=\"Don&#39;t Get Around Much Anymore\">Don't Get Around Much Anymore</a>\"/\"<a href=\"/wiki/I%27m_Just_a_Lucky_So-and-So\" title=\"I&#39;m Just a Lucky So-and-So\">I'm Just a Lucky So-and-So</a>\" (<a href=\"/wiki/Irving_Mills\" title=\"Irving Mills\">Irving Mills</a>, Duke Ellington, <a href=\"/wiki/Mitchell_Parish\" title=\"Mitchell Parish\">Mitchell Parish</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Bob_Russell_(songwriter)\" title=\"Bob Russell (songwriter)\">Bob Russell</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Juan_Tizol\" title=\"Juan Tizol\">Juan Tizol</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mack_David\" title=\"Mack David\">Mack David</a>)</li>\n<li>\"Work Song\" (<a href=\"/wiki/Nat_Adderley\" title=\"Nat Adderley\">Nat Adderley</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Oscar_Brown,_Jr.\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Oscar Brown, Jr.\">Oscar Brown, Jr.</a>)</li>\n<li>\"<a href=\"/wiki/Ma!_He%27s_Making_Eyes_at_Me\" title=\"Ma! He&#39;s Making Eyes at Me\">Ma (She's Making Eyes at Me)</a>\" (<a href=\"/wiki/Con_Conrad\" title=\"Con Conrad\">Con Conrad</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sidney_Clare\" title=\"Sidney Clare\">Sidney Clare</a>)</li></ol>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Personnel\">Personnel</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=At_Basin_Street_East_(Billy_Eckstine_and_Quincy_Jones_album)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Personnel\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Billy_Eckstine\" title=\"Billy Eckstine\">Billy Eckstine</a> – <a href=\"/wiki/Singing\" title=\"Singing\">vocals</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Quincy_Jones\" title=\"Quincy Jones\">Quincy Jones</a> – bandleader</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Referen